<title>USA: Scotts Q4 shr loss widens, includes charge.</title>
<headline>Scotts Q4 shr loss widens, includes charge.</headline>
<dateline>MARYSVILLE, Ohio 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     loss	     $0.86     loss	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net     loss	    13,600   profit	   100</p>
<p> Sales		    134,800		  169,700</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     loss	     $0.65   profit	 $0.99</p>
<p> Net     loss	     2,500   profit	22,400</p>
<p> Sales		    751,900		  732,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Scotts Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the net loss in 1996 reflected $17.7 million in unusual charges and a $3.1 million inventory markdown for discontinued products. The 1996 fourth quarter included $9.2 million in unusual charges and a $3.1 million inventory write-down.</p>
</text>
